00000000                             1  ; Project: The Snake Fella
00000000                             4  ; Date Created: 03/03/2026
00000000                             5  * Description: Snake Game with Alternative Physics systems.
00000000                             6  *
00000000                             7  *   KEYBOARD NOTE:
00000000                             8  *   Input is handled by polling task 19 inside READ_KEYS each
00000000                             9  *   game tick. No interrupt vector or ENABLEKEYBOARD is used,
00000000                            10  *   avoiding the SSP crash caused by RTE with no interrupt frame.
00000000                            11  *
00000000                            12  *   PHYSICS FEATURES:
00000000                            13  *   1. DATA VALIDATION  - Difficulty select. Only 1/2/3 accepted.
00000000                            14  *   2. RESOURCE USAGE   - Fuel drains at 0.5 per tick (every other
00000000                            15  *                         tick via FUEL_TICK toggle). Restored by
00000000                            16  *                         eating food. Zero fuel = dead.
00000000                            17  *   3. HANDLING DAMAGE  - Wall Wrap + Shields. Crossing a wall
00000000                            18  *                         teleports the snake and costs one shield.
00000000                            19  *                         Zero shields on impact = dead.
00000000                            20  *   4. DYNAMIC EVENTS   - Solar Flare. 1/32 chance per tick.
00000000                            21  *                         2-second flashing warning before it
00000000                            22  *                         activates. 7-second cooldown after it
00000000                            23  *                         ends before it can trigger again.
00000000                            24  *                         Controls reversed while active.
00000000                            25  *                         Border: flashing yellow/green warning,
00000000                            26  *                         solid yellow while active.
00000000                            27  *   5. SPEED BOOST      - Space bar. 5-tick burst, halves delay.
00000000                            28  *                         Costs extra fuel per tick.
00000000                            29  *
00000000                            30  *   Arrow Keys to steer, Space to Boost, ESC to quit.
00000000                            31  *-----------------------------------------------------------
00000000                            32  
