00001708                           844  * Subroutine    : Draw Border
00001708                           845  * Description   : Border colour reflects the flare state machine:
00001708                           846  *
00001708                           847  *   IDLE / COOLDOWN  : DARKGREEN  (normal)
00001708                           848  *   FLARE_WARNING    : alternates YELLOW / DARKGREEN each tick
00001708                           849  *                      using WARN_FLASH toggle to create a visible
00001708                           850  *                      flashing alert before controls are reversed
